topic variable `$_` is a special variable called the _topic variable_. consider the loop over a range: for 1..5 -> $n {
    say $n;
} the variable `$n` can be omitted, in which case it will be replaced with an automatically generated variable `$_`. the program is equivalent to the following: for 1..5 {
    say $_;
} as you [remember](/essentials/hello-world/), it is possible to use `say` as a method: for 1..5 {
    $_.say;
} calling methods on `$_` does not require mentioning the variable itself. so, our loop can be simplified further: for 1..5 {
    .say;
}

